@[spell-sources step]
Spell sources on the ISO (in /var/spool/sorcery/) can be copied to the new
system, so their spells can be cast there without network access. This ISO
may carry none (@[enchantment select sources show] tells you); then just skip
this step: sorcery downloads what it needs once the new system is online.

  @[enchantment select sources]              # menu: space toggles, enter accepts
  @[enchantment select sources show]         # list the selection
  @[enchantment select sources add 'glob*']  # add files matching a pattern
  @[enchantment select sources del 'glob*']  # remove files matching a pattern

The selection is a plain list of file names, one per line, which you can also
edit directly: @[$EDITOR $ENCHANT_TMP/spell-sources]

When you are finished selecting, type @[next].
